{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1227,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18742c9f380707620d084631",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "“自己笠上雪，虽厚不觉重”。\r\n无论是多么艰苦的训练也全是为了自己。",
      "source_fingerprint": "52ee1f5dd3b5b6dd2697ae6df3b0b3281ed6c868090ff4feaa58890cb3746643",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c87c8ebe685317817b51dcf5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很喜欢月光映照出的影子。\r\n比起太阳照射出的影子来说更为朦胧\r\n不觉得这样很有情调吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1a378e841f60acc250608c194d785d0230d53ba4eeba07090aa0ad523a74eb9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c5275309598b442840e26d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今早，被黄莺的叫声叫醒了～。\r\n这可是春天独有的闹钟呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "463d28e69979ff1b55a2207b6721b873a81b650b37ce473f88f971686dbbe5f7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8fefa72bcd646e7433d9165f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一到这时候就很容易睡不够呢……\r\n训练员难道不会在意吗？\r\n那误入房间的虫子的振翅声。",
      "source_fingerprint": "782149b0e92484d2488217ebe95c651d5abbfa3d371d4d86cfc541840949ffb9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f77a86cdb2e249fedaf9d26",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "诶呀？\r\n训练员的肩膀上沾着红叶呢……\r\n呼呼，小小的秋天，被我发现啦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6faf3cf4a44cb70b4ff147c760e95ae99ee5b37dd525c3edc9cac50c2889b9d5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b812ef39f9a3c43c5bb5bebc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ぴりっとした寒さ…こたえますが、\r\n私は結構好きですよ。\r\n身が引き締まる感じがしますから。",
      "source_fingerprint": "977c237cd4577e149b3c8b8d1cb71e56e17fdf2e9c1cd05c77d43d67f7ebc9cd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3c2c4c737b5dfc23cb40ce1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "VR游戏什么的，\r\n玩起来感觉十分地真实，很厉害呢……\r\n不知道有没有关于茶道或是花道的VR游戏呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "702303ff301b091a13197012ea87ead44feb368891da653954d3810f9051f2f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c74bac4bd139e85a2bda497b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然游戏给了我好像很难的印象，\r\n但通关的时候……\r\n能获得和赢得比赛时完全不同的成就感呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "e5888bea1b886402c5667d845e7be22b7e2e8548261034b535a55909fceefec6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6c2248baa2685d98c7ece17",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呣……小鹰真是的，\r\n又把作业忘的一干二净了。\r\n……看来又是说教魔法出场的时候了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "593d7a9438951bfac43cb21d503db8189707487f3a7f62e3093b1d52d6ec8c26",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:73781817cdb1c1c67c2c1e12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能够最快的赶到需要治疗的人们的身边，\r\n也是治愈师的义务。\r\n所以训练也要好好地进行呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "316da8498277cf3df68bc1559db47636897edea6bb2e5c8926fb08bf90a18760",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c70852a03a1c6119eacc218f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "如果能够使用瞬间移动的魔法的话，\r\n就可以随时参加在全国各地的赛跑场上举办的比赛了……\r\n看来这也是一种很好的武者修行呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "ccb2cd567ca00c12208b500335a97b59caccbe89e44169bb8742348760d80f23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bed176a875e3b7c18891ce4f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "海马是红色的，A-I-U-E-O。\r\n嗯，看来今天也能好好地咏唱出魔法了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a396aa1ff812ed27c0670f0f3319e1e1e51a3cdcf159a3287b4ce69b5e73a70",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:86896d13a634585a781f9d6a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在我咏唱法术的时候\r\n敌人都没有乘机攻击我，\r\n感觉到了一种很特别的情绪呢～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "999e97a431c984610bd594de7322e9422aaa550b9077b1b6fcb9e5ba94668849",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3546291bb126adcb9f96565",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "虽然俗话说“有福不用忙”……\r\n但睡前的努力才是结果的源泉。\r\n那么，一起来为了明天的冒险而做足准备吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "081d77cbc15a542219abe3e622e71cf58ed2f54de25876e2d838b485dc485537",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7befa46c95659fac2c5a3b5e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "阿嚏……\r\n难道是花之妖精的恶作剧吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "831e5e04a5f909fbbd8d2c90a22537133017131ad297082389922ca944fe496f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8c603f4ecd35c3b61c5c471",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在这炎热的夏天里，\r\n就让我们一起享受日本自古以来的魔道具……\r\n风铃【Cool Charm】的恩惠吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cad682c9d14b59f8d5920190c7643cf25a1ea53bd25cc8b66a5cf2c74a6328da",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2c26205dd3b94c60b79720bd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是个想要去山上观赏红叶的季节呢～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a832c24d2d6f461ad877deec6f46b14bc9ff25eb189bf7c389ccbc48bbf7331f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58588a131baf5a89398d01b5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼……天气这么冷的话，\r\n就会让人想去温泉旅馆里回复一下了呢。\r\n顺带再喝上一瓶咖啡牛奶【药水】♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf63667863dd577fdb1987ec5a08ac07e511a70ec5224604a12ec348d6a19e29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a621aa37c3cb9ac326c83e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最近拜托我来按摩的人也多起来了。\r\n就想着稍微去学习一下相关的知识吧～。\r\n……而且对受伤时的护理也有帮助。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b71ac3a628956c42189cedd404adb1fdf4723ac58aa66e56d4ae4b5902bef7d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:912e6fc18aee02b0646fed0c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "治愈师是治愈大家的生命线……\r\n可得时常准备好回复药【和果子】呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd8d63956aa1c4047aa5edcea4b9eacfcef24a567da090f04d4184ccfc3240af",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:058d1702d1e267308ca1a907",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "您心情如何？\r\n今天也一起加油吧～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0dc5ca166d27866c1642ec8a0988d6c574ca1e976a9b055179f8385a79d9251d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff5e1e372cd0758e0d4cbb78",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "頑張りますね～",
      "source_fingerprint": "80ff6f5bde34db00ec59654aa3b8afd6a8e07c3cc3c2b3321fb88e0be26832f4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39e262db4e85bca907004b0d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那么……今天也请多多指教了。\r\n好好地锻炼一下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4f5c4f37b055f4bfd61e996c730e8840836d4be18a726851651fcb3f9ce61b1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e90ec8a0b4746d38edcfca3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练的准备已经做好了，\r\n无论什么时候开始都可以哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee0f30f23c66704ac8a0bc8afaae1f6aa34a82ba2a3b2ee34a33aa5782d5b846",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bdc1e93ab4ce3891425eeea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天有什么安排呢？\r\n就算是基础训练也不要偷工减料哦。\r\n正所谓勿忘初心，的说。",
      "source_fingerprint": "500ca9caa9a951fca446d306b2fd799c802f4ea4fa92e90c9e86d2ddb185d85e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f29f5a1ade7537c94fd1216",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一直都很期待着训练呢。\r\n这都是托了训练员的福。",
      "source_fingerprint": "763b1d9744d066c7fb266cb5e0ac09cf803afe5ddd571009c1119dd69ccb290c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a47bd86b3ec3d4efe71ea77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一直在为我思考着训练清单什么的，\r\n非常感谢。我一定会回应\r\n训练员对我的这份期待的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "58e1e8666d401d3ad882e6eadc36c44dfb8cc37bf1f0e166f7dc125829c75625",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a82ad81f86d8d23d15f96d43",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也让我们一同庄严地踏上，\r\n所应当前往的“道路”吧。\r\n……与作为引导的灯火的您一起。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7181c6c200c777f51e2029357307dc5c09ba2c1f4223f7a54f17caefb10b4d65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ecbb4ac42b8b48cefe50a8cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每日都有着自身在不断成长的实感。\r\n这也是我一人所无法品味到的感觉吧。\r\n……呵呵。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ccba39ce50641cea0140e53ceca6daed59ef587f017d79ae08cbcb8a2dd4e7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d0c6c0b52ec9e4ad1e89355",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "上天啊，\r\n还请您一定要护佑这纯洁治愈师。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a5a274e21ed09af8cfdb71a42e2e5024cda6701d2c1b241f296f49e9c8c7e1d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:340687fb866970e799e0def5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "向着训练任务，出发♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d818bf6034d913a365cc8515f73caf096ad501b826f71643ea1abb31ad375b8f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f6eeea31e4751bb15b6c7e4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冒险也要从点滴的事做起呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "56acc12ec8974966ae4edac90260358539e8313e9989d114cd23ea1d7b1152b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ff4a031c4c4a2222930ded3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以Happy End为目标，一同前进吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4841e8704e56cf2168ac715f76cc1c3e52cca17ff5b7a9cadda29dafe6068a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:504fd52aaf82a5fb94799097",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…就算是咏唱魔法时\r\n也会不小心就以五・七・五的形式念出来呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f3828a7ba230a66451b9350aa98d4d129dbb22eb349fdc4011f605f7f142961",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e16c42b50b02e48079727616",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "回复【增益治疗】…呵呵。\r\n总感觉还能接着跑下去呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b387ae18f90edab56594f259ccba454d8cf98f43b27da9deb7f35b6e6c905439",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de82c454407ebe3ee4c7daea",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小鹰是格斗家，我是治愈师。\r\n那么……指引我们的训练员也许就是勇者了呢♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd573df83fbca57398be52fa2235c4fb78a20b778f409822ba82ef99993a1128",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1aa6a0f0b38c1c6533ef3360",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这条荣光之路……今后也想与您一同前行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1916cdf5d767049045c940bbd4759aa87d791b947e5d6e226d5f433714eacc68",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f7fb7b7b7e6f0d1035d306c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对奔跑的执着，可没有尽头呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "69b4d801d508af32615adecb3719807e2d1429dbc575b62cb2264ef99b3913c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:788dc98c4535cb6bea2cbd71",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "向训练员给予我的加护，献上感谢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "67bcd7feb8ef06f9f8c7c434ea99d440c58f7bd7ae0ec88ec3e42e273c79c021",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9e1c5f3384c56113eceb098",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在“New Game”中也，与我一起冒险吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "640b2056f8bea2186fa7493e3f8fbba458caaddc3bcd8efbedefd27f15218e82",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8525ca705f86109ac73bd745",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了胜利，我会继续努力精进的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "27f4aed16f770ef3a1f4f25f89ca7fb340464d08fec07ccd5226b664a781912e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d3fce492f53d3e015fe25792",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "对我的这份期待，我一定会将其实现♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "f2a9c0cc53d32eae079522e66f0f976ce6eb61f5a7cf817562e81101681594bf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8aacc1c01c81a13028fde8ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "草上飞，参上。",
      "source_fingerprint": "99704b50af7319f0c1edb4f9162e1ebbcd398c609a3c1925cb0f29f8a1a4c195",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18db32f2a103e772f95edcac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "支援的话就请交给我吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4dc5594b64a8e2eb4b439629fd47446e090eedfd402f29e7083cb510e0ca16e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:011b92f6127e146e138b2641",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会比以往更加努力，成为大家的力量。",
      "source_fingerprint": "02673bde897da9da17bb6322c0798a5c2f3c11e6c8402205895055d1b9c62779",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:01cd471c7bd8518af807a8ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "叮叮♪获得经验值～。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ddc127c528f14bdecafd53e8b4391a946503bf923177430a637643d1204f45c6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37ae746b1861878c3cf9eb6e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "等级提升！向着新天地，进发。",
      "source_fingerprint": "12f00f655b60af738babb2956bedb0ba0e1a37027e4e9fe512181628b8add7c5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f985a6af489ec418712d0ac4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "清廉的治愈师草上飞。\r\n为你献上胜利的治愈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9be7f0ebcf2e809180fc2d925d4cbb65ca73fc52320624b5e93df9fd368bdf02",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dab6f0ad5b51e8fb9c58a2bc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是，我是草上飞。\r\n不管是赛跑还是治愈，都请交给我吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d91ac404a45c203f20d646fbf6d0ef962546740e4fb9b7ba1baae620403cf50",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1011",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d973136431835b396131618b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "干劲十足，那么就出发吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6d5bb8baefdba1dea28b4ab24e31cf0f43f6d3a23dcfb55374c206f4acf8dc1d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9f111d204e682c19de22a05",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说起来啊、自叫你“训练公”开始\r\n好像已经过了很久了呢……诶呀、\r\n之前我是怎么叫你的来着？",
      "source_fingerprint": "28a7ca9e732ab600d4736c4064478434fd08ce8e0c9117eed96148f9cf9a606e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6c7b0dcaffb9bf7d09330ad9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくるよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7da79748cc0c78260452eff6f93ce5c5aa46913a8d4199c892b59c4e329c3594",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a124cf9d11cdd52d3a0f4c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "戻ったよー！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ef8b51865b2eb1a8bf5e2ba36cc5600593d9596018c444064914762bdba8727",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a94e8b90f89a9aae31f1e363",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我之所以能够一直昂首挺胸、\r\n就是因为有你在背后支持着我啊。\r\n从今往后也拜托了哦，训练公！",
      "source_fingerprint": "44ba254de3ea2568f0d38adef4c054046b3d68983191a1aca8de1dde91203b49",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3c9bf4baf673da6fce47d12",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我和你的组合可是无人能敌的哟。\r\n无论什么对手都放马过来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbcfcddae6613392ed7e511dba44eb434b6a3065907ba48ae7c9a858d689ad9c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1e9a24aa07460731568697a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "门松还有镜饼……虽然要准备的东西有很多、\r\n但是只要宿舍里的小家伙们能够开心的话，\r\n就已经十分值得了啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "892ad0d8f1b63de0becd80113120327784ddc00f32edf6144818d123c0059d31",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23e63ddbb5f58379941ee57d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每到这个时候我就会很忙呢。\r\n毕竟要给宿舍的小家伙们\r\n都做一份巧克力才行啊！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b05b1752df1db8db8c4ae930a1fe5d54d9aec3e137d954ec18723fd1cb993b28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20a62ab7c6c4f0976fffff10",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "巧克力做多了呢……\r\n那个、如果不嫌弃的话就吃了吧……\r\n对于味道我还是很自信的哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cbee5961a34d6be5a8f870b893e89038003a8bfd2506ca9e1dc65dc5d7ba9b8c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8187ff42ba25c8a38dfdd91b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练公你许了什么愿望？\r\n我的话当然是、“健康祈愿”！\r\n毕竟只有身体健康才能好好单挑嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "818972ddd9ca415a846e79df0b84c971e819ae629a0d29c0bb0f4927e2b941f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af52ebcfeba72ad4850b24a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "万圣节快乐！\r\n虽然要糖果也好恶作剧也好都没问题，\r\n但是睡前可一定要好好刷牙哦？",
      "source_fingerprint": "183ff5e1f63ef66dce150bee75a943e8c1a03b9cf52fcb90e0a0fb1444fb0ba5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ac5ab64934c8447cee0b7d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣诞节时想给宿舍的大家做一下烤火鸡呢。\r\n这可是我老家食堂里的人气菜品哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cea59794493a1c4361507fe312f72d1c2ee732a385e8433e65ed90c3e39fae97",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc2ea43269582f06730fdb7a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣诞节快乐！训练公！\r\n已经去过训练员室了吗？\r\n说不定那里会发生些什么哟？哼哼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4225fa1536867f216f0dbeb44d70bcc02310d55b5d4753ce7607f0be266547cc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b43f802aa271e346e784c557",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "输得心服口服了吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4c4f335cd9f27d34154af9a5e6d27665e5141301d255596b5d755afec731c935",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c4e7a5d0fea5fe12ee77810",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年一整年也辛苦你了。\r\n我也就趁着今天稍微休息一下吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bdfe44da4e5bd7bfc1ab441821eec93eba35d46089c8e3a4c1a61f3ad246662",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e126549509ecbcddaa09611",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练公、今天不是你的生日嘛！\r\n好，那么就叫上宿舍的小家伙们，\r\n大家一起开个生日派对吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fb7ac4775a7f6de610861d5d8ef36ac953bc391455b930c085c8bbe536f4c09",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6edf6438224cecc379330b5f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你有什么想吃的菜吗？\r\n这就是我要送你的生日礼物哦！\r\n为了训练公你，今天我就稍微露一手吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf46005bb3ce592f8025184bf4364074eed841a73978b6fc33c5f286690dc826",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcc40199b9c32eff06513c48",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说我啊！宿舍的那帮小家伙们、\r\n居然给我开了生日派对……呜。\r\n我啊、还真是幸福的人呀！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a4d99fe919763428812a293a5ba3fcd192d44156ea7e0248c6954db3917ce11",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd8f9a10155351633e0aa00f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "给我的生日礼物？\r\n嗯，是呢……“明年也和你一起庆祝我的生日”\r\n……这样就足够了哟。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2cda11d46a89ad4a4d78a027299fc258f4e287fe381a1a50b8889f325045f325",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:042188aac4ed937a49552b2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像收到了通知哟。\r\n难道是、战书吗！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "52b0c19c935482945f064b76c2263ea2abe34eee62e1b3ca44870ad61127336d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:905b14cae13d008328915270",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有给你的礼物哟。\r\n收到了什么东西呢？\r\n让你菱亚马逊姐也稍微看看嘛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c80fb8aad926ef86f967e65fffe918701d310477eb6ea512de5a96ddb26a5dca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4cf11fbe121e40f28edd0da8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看起来任务好像完成了呢。\r\n挺能干的嘛、训练公！\r\n保持这种状态，下个任务也要好好加油哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d60094ad037f156b0c3512c914f333a31772441bff173fb9bb8399189ef02ede",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6be8a63fefba65a0fef7ed2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动好像很快就要开始了呢……\r\n我已经做好准备了哟。\r\n随时都可以开始单挑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "582922cc71aba2a68680a817090822a7b1b84762251977db6df0edbf3a9378ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8ce917d4983a28f728b12fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动不是已经开始了嘛！\r\n你不去参加一下吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "6875b32abe29a3a8c6e77d787c45ce00d9d010458419ef7e448d017fd725f73e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d243d246efe0b6c5072e8ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可恶～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d85f71b009b5c89f44d5a53ba30273572ca27e96ae97021c5efab08224297f79",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a13b686c787632ce0dcf8ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘名鉴的等级提升了哟！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ddc36c3ef186a3eea13f97a9486a089175638c403c07bb5fda49f4e3f6137f0e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e189acddf503d1312d07a6f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どっちかっていうと\r\n風通しのいい服が好きだね！\r\nスカッとしてて気持ちいいだろ？",
      "source_fingerprint": "92c3ec22e733d33fcc1517c83c5ce924d1795e9bb2d57c6c7fdd0736808350e9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b87caf09fa21b5e03a0623dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この赤が結構目立つみたいでね。\r\n人ごみに紛れても追っかけやすくて\r\nいいって評判さ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "743459434b50452b038c431a400b01c32c22e2faea42c16fb5a323b821b61f7c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9bb9c981ebdf47e8acd11331",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "アクセサリーは服と一緒に買った\r\nんだ。『合うんじゃないか』って…\r\nブライアンの言う通りだったよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "213b442ec93d056b3325b81ddbf72f420f885f6a6f9edf33da75e98c699f4b25",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9f5c7a11e46f17e8d4bbf79c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还不坏嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2830099322007f65999c97d20d8d225664e79180680e730db2c0c63c5c8b20bd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:869a9cacba64ef522480a3a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你们几个，干得漂亮！",
      "source_fingerprint": "64544a73624ebbb426b34bda9f55e7a6a6f6c89a2411e7265e35535673acedb1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1012",
        "1004"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
